      "raw": "When a customer holds a bond that reaches its maturity date, DriveWealth automatically processes the return of the bond's principal amount. This event is recorded as a transaction in the customer's account, reflecting the repayment of the bond's face value.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "When a customer holds a bond that reaches its maturity date, DriveWealth automatically processes the return of the bond's principal amount. This event is recorded as a transaction in the customer's account, reflecting the repayment of the bond's face value.",
